<title>JAPAN: Murdoch says not considering buying Dow Jones.</title>
<headline>Murdoch says not considering buying Dow Jones.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-05-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Media tycoon Rupert Murdoch told Reuters on Thursday in Tokyo that he has never seriously considered buying Dow Jones and Co Inc.</p>
<p>Asked if he was interested in buying Dow Jones, he said: &quot;No, no, no. I've never considered that seriously.&quot;  </p>
<p>He arrived in Tokyo earlier this week to announce new partners in his digital satellite broadcasting venture, Japan Sky Broadcasting Co, and to address an international seminar on periodicals and the media.  </p>
<p>Recent press reports have speculated on the possible sale of Dow Jones, and Murdoch's News Corp had been mentioned in some as a possible buyer of the publisher of the Wall Street Journal.</p>
